BSIM3 NMOS short and long channel current versus Vd
* Provenance: original Sansho circuit and parameter choices from the BSIM3v3.3 parameter list.
.model nch nmos level=8 version=3.3
+ tox=8n xj=0.13u nch=2.1e17 vth0=0.54 k1=0.52 k2=-0.023
+ u0=460 vsat=92000 rdsw=85 pclm=1.15
+ lint=9n wint=15n cgso=170p cgdo=150p cf=65p mobmod=1 k3=28 ags=0.09 prwg=0.08 alpha0=0.15u beta0=2.7
Vd bias 0 0
Vg gate 0 0
Vb bulk 0 -0.45
Vsht bias ds 0
Vlng bias dl 0
Ms ds gate 0 bulk nch w=2.4u l=0.38u
Ml dl gate 0 bulk nch w=2.4u l=2.2u
.dc Vd 0 1.8 0.025 Vg 0.65 1.65 0.5
.save i(Vsht) i(Vlng) i(Vb)
.end
